================================================================================
COMPONENTS AND ORIGINAL CONTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================

The following components represent original contributions by the author:

1. Bisection-based fraud proof protocol for RandomX execution disputes
   - src/challenge.cairo

2. ERC20 bond enforcement for fraud proof participation
   - Challenger and defender bond staking via IERC20

3. Optimistic execution model for RandomX proof-of-work verification
   - Challenge/defend/bisect/prove protocol

